{"serviceId":"webhook-listener-01","adapterType":"webhook-listener","description":"Inbound HTTP webhook receiver. Converts an accepted webhook into a FileWriteRequested command and publishes it. Fire-and-forget from the HTTP caller's perspective (§8) — no reply subject needed yet.\n","permissions":{"publish":["events.files.FileWriteRequested"],"subscribe":[]}}
