A quoting artifact from my nested wrapper, not a real result — spaces in the args got split. Let me retest #5 and #7 with single-word payloads:

Bash Retest denied publish and denied KV write with single-word payloads
IN
cd /home/bherring/dev/clodhopper/GregorsServiceBus
CREDS="infra/nats/operator/creds"

as() {
  local who="$1"; shift
  sg docker -c "docker run --rm --network gsb_default -v \"\$(pwd)/$CREDS:/creds:ro\" natsio/nats-box:0.19.7-nonroot nats --server nats://nats:4222 --creds /creds/$who.creds $*"
}

